10_6877594147168239640_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CHhmNgmLaZwQ7kNvwHJ4Alv&_nc_oc=AdpTs-K9j0BtJUUkiYYjZExPfawZjhGsEa0w-Lpaa6OsHbUv7QOQfQunOCgPyF-cDvA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af190sJUo9THNrulti87xZWhwtM9w2XY8klQ8qmpDagUeA&oe=69E8DA4C"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "2953570888277783", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392093_2953570891611116_6048066563426032845_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=R0_4hoc6BQMQ7kNvwEfb2nd&_nc_oc=Adp2A6ElIfla-q98gxPSNMxra9ALMBZuGDPC8xG6Fq909tXk_XfUMLJolBsGLUf3KLI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0zYwLmguIvXZz9XCGl11TcR1QUipetiP-Yh8YfkGwrLQ&oe=69E8B2FC"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "The Finders_Cover Landscape.png", "id": "1629436301031148", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392069_1629436304364481_4255148496526447739_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7HJMCHPv7gQQ7kNvwFYX6jk&_nc_oc=AdrHobnDQjXwdQD0ztNGi3CSMlxldGDw4FK-O3mU5rEiVyPFRF79RaC77YRiAEV0Dgg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3oOyqLybeq7WkAPBFfV7cjD9jSO42sRJGO26MaPx_IAg&oe=69E8CA2B"}, "display_name": "The Finders", "keywords": ["pet", "cat", "finding", "challenge", "finder"], "long_description": "\"The Finders\" is a VR game that challenges players to find objects throughout Pet-World. It\u2019s a mini open-world game where players can explore maps, complete exciting quests, play various mini-games, hang out with other players (Coming Soon), collect objects, and level up to become the best \"Finder.\"\n\nFeatures:\n\u30fbCute animals\n\u30fbSandbox exploration\n\u30fbMain quest \n\u30fbMini-games\n\nMore features will be added every month. So, stay tuned with us!", "short_description": "\"The Finders\" is a VR game that challenges players to find objects throughout Pet-World. It\u2019s a mini open-world game where players can explore